<title>DENMARK: Rieber says holds 34.2 pct in Phoenix.</title>
<headline>Rieber says holds 34.2 pct in Phoenix.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Rieber and Son, one of two bidders for Danish roadbuilder Phoenix Contractors, said on Wednesday that it had increased its stake to 34.2 percent of Phoenix equity from 32.6 percent.</p>
</text>
